  "topicName": "EQ2: Why do some tectonic hazards develop into disasters?",
  "text": "(i) Using Figure 1b complete Figure 1a by stating the duration of earthquake C.\n(ii) Complete Figure 1b by plotting earthquake F using the data from Figure 1a.\n(iii) Draw a regression (best-fit) line on Figure 1b to show the relationship\nbetween earthquake magnitude and duration.",
  "ms": "AO3 (4 marks) Mark number (1)\n(i) Award 1 mark for the correct reading of 500 seconds\n(ii) Award 1 mark for correct plotting of the magnitude (2)\n(iii)\nAward 1 mark for the correct plotting of the duration The point must be on the line for 7.3 The point must be above the line for 20 but not on the 30 Award 1 mark for a straight line drawn:\n1. Within the grey area shown (1)\n2. With a reasonably even and balanced distribution of points on either side of that line",
