  "topicName": "EQ2: Why do some tectonic hazards develop into disasters?",
  "text": "(i) Calculate the mean magnitude of these earthquakes.\nGive your answer to one decimal place.\n(ii) Calculate the median number of deaths caused by these earthquakes. ............................... MMS\n(iii) Calculate the interquartile range of deaths caused by these earthquakes. ...............................\nYou must show your working.\n",
  "ms": "Indicative content Mark number (1)\nAO3 (4 marks) (1)\n(2)\n(i) 1 mark for mean of 7.4 (mean is 7.37 so to one decimal place 7.4)\n1 mark for the median 103\n(ii)\n(iii)\n1 mark for the working of 1115 – 23\n1 mark for the interquartile range of 1092",
