  "topicName": null,
  "text": "Suggest one possible impact of the changes shown on forest ecosystems.\n",
  "ms": "Indicative content Mark number Suggest one possible impact of the changes shown on (3)\nforest ecosystems.\nAO1 – 2 marks/AO2 – 1 marks Award 1 AO2 mark for analysing the resource to identify the impact on forest ecosystems caused by the changes in precipitation and a further 2 AO1 marks expansion up to a maximum of 3 marks to explain these impacts. For example:\n• Summer precipitation totals will decrease by 35% by 2100\n(1). This will reduce soil moisture (1) and so increase water stress and so risk of disease for forests (1).\n• Summer precipitation totals will decrease by 35% by 2100\n(1). This reduces photosynthesis (1) and so reduces primary productivity (1).\n• Summer precipitation totals will decrease by 35% by 2100(1). Reductions in photosynthesis (1) reduces primary productivity (1) reduces population numbers of secondary consumers (1)\nAccept other explanations for the impact of changes on forest ecosystems.",
