  "eqConfident": false,
  "topicCode": null,
  "topicName": null,
  "text": "Explain why defence spending is seen as crucial to the development of\nsuperpower status.",
  "ms": "Answer Mark number (4)\nAO1 (4 marks)\nAward 1 mark for identifying a reason why defence spending is seen as crucial, and a further 3 marks for expansion up to a maximum of 4 marks. For example:\n• Defence spending is critical to the exercise of hard power (1) because it enables territorial expansion and/or the protection of current territory (1), which in turn brings wealth through acquisition of resources (1), allowing the maintenance/growth of the economy needed to develop superpower status (1).\nAccept any other appropriate response.\n96 Pearson Edexcel Level 3 Advanced GCE in Geography – Sample Assessment Materials – Issue 2 – February 2017 © Pearson Education Limited 2017",
  "pageFrom": 4,
  "pageTo": 4,
  "pdf": "Exam questions PDFs/A-Level Geography/Paper 2 (Human)/Questions/Specimen QP.pdf",
  "rb": "Exam questions PDFs/A-Level Geography/Paper 2 (Human)/Resource Booklet/Specimen RB.pdf",
  "rbFrom": null,
  "rbTo": null,
