  "inSpec": true,
  "eq": "geo3-2",
  "eqConfident": true,
  "topicCode": "3.2",
  "topicName": "EQ2: What are the impacts of globalisation?",
  "text": "Explain one reason why the global shift of industry has had negative impacts on\nsome people in the developed world.",
  "ms": "Answer Mark number (4)\nAO1 (4 marks)\nAward 1 mark for identifying a reason why the global shift of industry has created losers in the developed world and a further 3 marks for expansion up to a maximum of 4 marks.\n Unemployment  has reduced local incomes and therefore government tax revenue  so investment declines in infrastructure/local services .\n Depopulation  means the more skilled/educated leave  and mental health issues increase  due to lack of hope and self- esteem of those left behind.\n Accept any other appropriate response.",
  "pageFrom": 2,
  "pageTo": 2,
  "pdf": "Exam questions PDFs/A-Level Geography/Paper 2 (Human)/Questions/June 2018 QP.pdf",
  "rb": "Exam questions PDFs/A-Level Geography/Paper 2 (Human)/Resource Booklet/June 2018 RB.pdf",
