  "eq": "geo3-2",
  "eqConfident": true,
  "topicCode": "3.2",
  "topicName": "EQ2: What are the impacts of globalisation?",
  "text": "Explain one reason why many people in the developed world support the global\nshift of industry.",
  "ms": "Explain one reason why many people in the developed world support Mark number the global shift of industry (4)\nAO1 (4 marks)\nAward 1 mark for a reason people support for shift, with up to a further 3 marks for an explanation to a maximum of 4 marks.\nFor example:\n Cost of goods to developed world customers is becoming cheaper\n(1) due to lower cost overseas (1) as cost of living in developing world is lower(1) e.g. average price of smart phones in 2019 is less than in 2011 (1).\n Factories move overseas so less air/water pollution (1) and reduced threats to health (1) so reduced costs for health treatments(1) so government can spend on other priorities (1).\n Business owners outsource to Asia as it is economically worthwhile(1) as wage costs are lower(1) so profits increase (1)\nand the business can invest in new infrastructure/designs (1).\nAllow one mark for an example with a detail (see first bullet point above)\n‘Lower cost of labour’ can only be credited as an extension mark, not on its own.\nIf more than one reason is given, credit the stronger one.\nAccept any other appropriate response.\n4",
  "pageFrom": 2,
  "pageTo": 2,
