  "topicName": "EQ2: What are the impacts of globalisation?",
  "text": "(i) Complete Figure 2 below by adding the GII and GDP data for China from Figure 1.\nStates GII GDP per capita (PPP) ($)\n1800\nAfghanistan 0.65\nChina\nFigure 2\nData table\n(ii) Calculate the range for the GII data for the countries shown in Figure 1.\n(iii) Draw the line of best fit on Figure 1. Answer: ..............................................................\nStudy Figure 1 which shows the relationship between GDP per capita and GII (gender\ninequality index).",
  "ms": "Answer PMT\nAO3 (4 marks) Mark Award 1 mark for each task (4)\n(i) China 0.15 (accept 0.14 to 0.16) (1), GDP:15000 -15500 (1)\n(ii) Accept the following:\n0.04-0.05 for Belgium 0.65-0.68 for Afghanistan Acceptable range from 0.60 – 0.64\n(iii) Accept best fit lines drawn within the range shown below:\nCandidates do not need to take the line of best fit to the x or y axis",
