  "q": "6",
  "part": "c",
  "marks": 8,
  "topic": "geo-t8b",
  "topicConfident": true,
  "inSpec": false,
  "eq": null,
  "eqConfident": false,
  "topicCode": null,
  "topicName": null,
  "text": "Explain why globalisation may cause political tensions within nations.",
  "ms": "AO1 (8 marks)\n• Tensions may result from the role of TNCs leading to cultural change, environmental damage and growing inequality within nations.\n• Political tensions exist in BRIC countries, for example in China there is wide difference of opportunity between the rural and urban areas, due to TNC investment in SEZs in coastal urban areas.\n• Minority groups including the Uighyr and Rohingha have experienced persecution by state governments fearful of their different cultures and terrorism elsewhere so tries to restrict their freedoms.\n• Emerging powers may seek to win access to resources by investing and supporting governments, which can foster further tension.\n• Spread of global culture/migration creates tensions in traditional communities.\nAccept any other appropriate response Level Mark Descriptor\nLevel 1 0\nLevel 2 1–2 No rewardable material.\nLevel 3 3–5 • Demonstrates isolated elements of geographical knowledge and understanding, some of which may be inaccurate or irrelevant.\n6–8 (AO1)\n• Understanding addresses a narrow range of geographical ideas, which lack detail. (AO1)\n• Demonstrates geographical knowledge and understanding, which is mostly relevant and may include some inaccuracies.\n(AO1)\n• Understanding addresses a range of geographical ideas, which are not fully detailed and/or developed. (AO1)\n• Demonstrates accurate and relevant geographical knowledge and understanding throughout. (AO1)\n• Understanding addresses a broad range of geographical ideas, which are detailed and fully developed. (AO1)",
  "pageFrom": 33,
  "pageTo": 33,
  "pdf": "Exam questions PDFs/A-Level Geography/Paper 2 (Human)/Questions/June 2021 QP.pdf",
  "rb": "Exam questions PDFs/A-Level Geography/Paper 2 (Human)/Questions/June 2021 QP.pdf",
  "rbFrom": 41,
