  "topicCode": null,
  "topicName": null,
  "text": "(i) Calculate the percentage increase in GDP per capita for New York between\n1999 and 2019.\nGive your answer to one decimal place.\nYou must show your working.\n............................... %\n\n(ii) Calculate the range of percentage (%) change in GDP for these states.\nYou must show your working.\n............................... %",
  "ms": "AO3 (2+2 marks) (2)\n(i)\n75131 – 55504 = 19627 (1) / 19627/55504 x 100 = 35.4% (1)\n(ii)\nOr 75,131/55,504 = 1/3.3636 (1) x 100 = 35.4% (1) (2)\n49.6 to -4.4 (1) = 54 (1)",
  "pageFrom": 5,
  "pageTo": 6,
  "pdf": "Exam questions PDFs/A-Level Geography/Paper 2 (Human)/Questions/June 2022 QP.pdf",
