  "text": "Using the data in Figure 4\n(i) Calculate the value of d2 for Iceland.\n(ii) Calculate ¦ d 2. ...............................\n(iii) Calculate the value of rs using the formula below.\n6¦ d 2 ...............................\nrs 1\u0010 2\nn\u000bn \u00101\nYou must show your working.\nGive your answer to two decimal places.\nrs = ...............................\n\nThe rs value is statistically significant at the 95% level, therefore the null\nhypothesis can be rejected, and the alternative hypothesis can be accepted.\nThe alternative hypothesis: there is a statistically significant relationship between\n% foreign born and cultural diversity.\n(iv) Suggest reasons for the relationship between % foreign born and cultural\ndiversity score.\n",
