  "topicCode": null,
  "topicName": null,
  "text": "Study Table 1 on Page 4 of the Question Paper and Figure 2 in Section A of the\nResource Booklet, both of which show data for the 10 ASEAN countries.\nAnalyse the differences in their social, economic and political development.",
  "ms": "",
